# Vehicle Rental System (C and Python)

## Project Overview
This project is a Vehicle Rental System implemented using two programming languages: C and Python.

It demonstrates the implementation of a vehicle rental application using fundamental programming concepts.

## Technologies Used
- C Programming
- Python
- Git and GitHub

## Project Files

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `projectv.c` | Vehicle Rental System in C |
| `project1.py` | Vehicle Rental System in Python |

## How to Run

### C Version
1. Open the terminal.
2. Compile the program:
   `gcc projectv.c -o projectv`
3. Run:
   `./projectv`

### Python Version
1. Make sure Python is installed.
2. Open the terminal.
3. Run:
   `python project1.py`

## Objective
The objective of this project is to develop a vehicle rental system and understand how programming concepts can be implemented in both C and Python.

